# MetaDefineLayer

This layer holds stable harness operating definitions, planning truth, design intent, gates, and approval boundaries.

## Owns root docs

- `MISSION.md`
- `ADR.md`
- `RUNBOOK.md`
- `EVAL.md`
- `RISKS.md`

## Owns managed collections

- `references/`
- `references/requests/`
- `references/specs/`
- `references/stories/`
- `references/domain/`
- `references/iterations/`
- `references/tasks/`
- `references/risks/`
- `decisions/`
